{
 "lines": {
  "bulletin|PAGASA has raised a red rainfall warning for the province. Torrential rain, more than thirty millimetres an hour, getting heavier over the next three hours. Serious flooding is expected in low-lying areas near rivers and creeks.": "bulletin-e0b496b845.ogg",
  "lito|Kap, you hear that? Red warning. And the creek sensor has been climbing all afternoon. Slow, but it never stops.": "lito-ff672802b4.ogg",
  "lito|The laptop is on. Look at what the forecast is saying.": "lito-0e68aa85e3.ogg",
  "lito|The forecast is still loading its history, Kap. Give it a moment and check again.": "lito-98355a130e.ogg",
  "lito|Good, that is out. People will start packing their go-bags.": "lito-bdb6b08ce7.ogg",
  "lito|Two things, Kap. The mats for the evacuation center are still rolled up in the corner. And at the sari-sari store they say the sensor is broken.": "lito-6ec017ef18.ogg",
  "lito|Can you check it against the staff gauge down at the creek? People will believe their own eyes.": "lito-b889d3c22f.ogg",
  "lito|Salamat, Kap. I will set up the registration table by the door.": "lito-aa1ccb776b.ogg",
  "jun|Kap, this is Jun at the bridge! The creek is over the bank. Water is on the road by the bridge!": "jun-d25f4a0ec4.ogg",
  "radio|Sound the siren, Kap! The switch is by the hall door, or use the dashboard.": "radio-1e87041ba5.ogg",
  "radio|And remember: Mang Ben across the creek never leaves, and Lola Cora lives alone by the river at the west end.": "radio-9dc91a1cdc.ogg",
  "jun|Kap, Aling Nena is here. Her boy Toto is missing! Someone saw him by the canal near the main road, watching the water.": "jun-f4c8fee31c.ogg",
  "radio|Siren is up! People are coming out with their bags.": "radio-9492a90e01.ogg",
  "ben|Kap, there is no flood. I have lived here forty years. I will watch the water myself.": "ben-825e08dad8.ogg",
  "ben|Kap! I told you, the water never reaches this house!": "ben-ad3ab17b95.ogg",
  "ben|...Within the hour? Sige, sige. Get the kids, we are going. Salamat, Kap.": "ben-6dd2f1ca06.ogg",
  "ben|We are packing, Kap! Two minutes!": "ben-cfad3e8de7.ogg",
  "lola|Ay, Kap. Is it bad already? Come back for me if it gets worse, ha?": "lola-0349480680.ogg",
  "lola|Ay, Kap... the water is at my steps. My knees... I can't run anymore.": "lola-c78f84dd62.ogg",
  "lola|You have a good heart, anak. Do not let go of me.": "lola-00ea20a829.ogg",
  "lola|Salamat, anak. God bless you. God bless you.": "lola-fb83bc3920.ogg",
  "toto|Kap! Look how high the water is! It is like a river now!": "toto-fbcf95a44b.ogg",
  "toto|Opo, Kap! Sorry po!": "toto-4438c47715.ogg",
  "nena|Toto! Anak, where did you go?! Salamat, Kap. Salamat po.": "nena-2808cd5129.ogg",
  "jun|Kap, the main road is going under! It is up to my knees here!": "jun-1147295f70.ogg",
  "radio|Kap, get everyone inside and come back to the hall. We need the headcount for the MDRRMO.": "radio-205d2bac35.ogg",
  "radio|No siren yet, so people are leaving on their own. Some are wading. Hurry, Kap!": "radio-62cb571d1a.ogg",
  "radio|Kap, the list matches. Everyone is inside. Come in and we will call it in.": "radio-1b1db0ac68.ogg",
  "lito|Twenty-three residents, all accounted for. Calling the MDRRMO now.": "lito-83776456d1.ogg",
  "lito|MDRRMO, this is Barangay San Roque. Everyone is in the evacuation center. Water at the sensor is over four metres and holding.": "lito-30a2161d30.ogg",
  "lito|Rest, Kap. You did good tonight.": "lito-7aeb2e5032.ogg",
  "lito|Check your phone, Kap. Everything the sensor sees is on the dashboard, with the forecast.": "lito-7ac8ba41b0.ogg",
  "lito|That is the Bantay Baha forecast, Kap. It takes PAGASA's rain outlook and how fast the creek has been rising, and looks an hour ahead.": "lito-d405c9bfbc.ogg",
  "lito|The sirens have not even gone off yet. If we move now, we move before the water does. Send an early advisory.": "lito-451c6e9a2f.ogg",
